      "source": "Use of reflection can be recorded for individual members of a type, as\nwell as broader <a href=\"MemberCategory.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.aot.hint\">member categories</a>. Access to\nresources can be specified using patterns or the base name of a resource\nbundle.",
